
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Lê Minh Nhật | Usagi World ♡</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Quicksand:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Pacifico&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
:root {
  --pink: #f3a6bd;
  --pink-light: #fff0f4;
  --cream: #fff8df;
  --brown: #60413c;
  --green: #b6cda5;
  --white: #fffdfb;
}

* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
  font-family: 'Quicksand', sans-serif;
  background: var(--white);
  color: var(--brown);
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

nav {
  position: fixed;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  width: 100%;
  z-index: 100;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 17px 8%;
  background: #fffdfbeF;
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  border-bottom: 2px solid #ffedf1;
}

.logo {
  font-size: 23px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #df829f;
}

nav a {
  text-decoration: none;
  color: var(--brown);
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-left: 22px;
  transition: .3s;
}

nav a:hover {
  color: #df829f;
}

.hero {
  min-height: 100vh;
  padding: 130px 10% 75px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 55px;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 10% 15%, #ffe8ef 0, transparent 30%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 90% 80%, #edf4e5 0, transparent 32%),
    #fffdfb;
}

.hero-text {
  flex: 1;
  max-width: 530px;
  animation: fadeUp 1s ease;
}

.tag {
  display: inline-block;
  background: white;
  border: 1px solid #f7cbd7;
  border-radius: 30px;
  padding: 10px 17px;
  color: #d77d98;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-bottom: 25px;
}

h1 {
  font-size: clamp(43px, 6vw, 72px);
  line-height: 1.2;
  letter-spacing: -2px;
}

h1 span {
  color: #e99ab1;
  font-family: 'Pacifico', cursive;
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: 0;
}

.number {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 20px;
  padding: 10px 19px;
  border-radius: 30px;
  background: #fff0f4;
  color: #cf7894;
  border: 1px solid #f4c7d4;
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 13px;
}

.intro {
  max-width: 440px;
  margin-top: 23px;
  line-height: 1.9;
  font-size: 15px;
  color: #907c76;
}

.btn {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 28px;
  padding: 14px 25px;
  border-radius: 30px;
  background: #ed9fb6;
  color: white;
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-decoration: none;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 20px #e99ab133;
  transition: .3s;
}

.btn:hover {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
  background: #da829d;
}

.bunny-box {
  position: relative;
  flex: 0 1 380px;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 380px;
  aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  border-radius: 48% 48% 35% 35%;
  background: linear-gradient(145deg, #fff0d2, #ffe2eb);
  box-shadow: 0 25px 60px #d9a4a429;
  animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.bunny-box img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  object-position: center 30%;
  border-radius: inherit;
}

.bunny-box::after {
  content: "♡";
  position: absolute;
  right: 20px;
  top: 20px;
  font-size: 35px;
  color: #e99ab1;
}

.decoration {
  position: absolute;
  font-size: 27px;
  animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
}

.deco1 {
  left: 7%;
  top: 18%;
}

.deco2 {
  right: 6%;
  bottom: 17%;
  animation-delay: 1s;
}

section:not(.hero) {
  padding: 90px 10%;
}

.heading {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 45px;
}

.heading small {
  color: #d77d98;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  font-size: 12px;
}

.heading h2 {
  margin-top: 12px;
  font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 43px);
}

.heading p {
  margin-top: 12px;
  color: #a18c83;
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

.about-grid,
.hobby-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 22px;
}

.card {
  padding: 30px 23px;
  background: white;
  border: 1px solid #f6e2e4;
  border-radius: 25px;
  text-align: center;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 30px #d9a4a410;
  transition: .3s;
}

.card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-8px);
  box-shadow: 0 15px 30px #d9a4a425;
}

.card .icon {
  font-size: 42px;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}

.card h3 {
  font-size: 17px;
  margin-bottom: 13px;
}

.card p {
  color: #9a8780;
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.9;
}

.hobbies {
  background: #fff1f4;
  border-radius: 40px;
  margin: 0 3%;
}

.hobby-card {
  background: white;
  overflow: hidden;
  border-radius: 23px;
  transition: .3s;
  border: 1px solid #f6e2e4;
}

.hobby-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-6px);
}

.hobby-picture {
  height: 155px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 68px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff0d8, #ffdfe9);
}

.hobby-card:nth-child(2) .hobby-picture {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0e8ff, #ffe7f0);
}

.hobby-card:nth-child(3) .hobby-picture {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e7f0df, #fff0d8);
}

.hobby-content {
  padding: 23px;
}

.hobby-content h3 {
  font-size: 17px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.hobby-content p {
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.8;
  color: #9a8780;
}

.message {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 100px 12% !important;
}

.message .heart {
  font-size: 43px;
  color: #e99ab1;
}

.message h2 {
  font-family: 'Pacifico', cursive;
  font-weight: 400;
  font-size: clamp(27px, 4vw, 42px);
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin: 20px 0;
}

.message p {
  color: #a18c83;
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

footer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 30px 15px;
  background: #fff1f4;
  border-top: 1px solid #f6e2e4;
  color: #a18c83;
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 2;
}

footer span {
  color: #d77d98;
}

#effects {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 999;
  pointer-events: none;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.pop {
  position: absolute;
  animation: rise 1.3s ease-out forwards;
  font-size: 23px;
}

@keyframes float {
  0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
  50% { transform: translateY(-12px); }
}

@keyframes fadeUp {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(22px);
  }
  to {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
}

@keyframes rise {
  from {
    transform: translateY(0) scale(.7);
    opacity: 1;
  }
  to {
    transform: translateY(-100px) scale(1.3);
    opacity: 0;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 800px) {
  nav {
    padding: 15px 5%;
  }

  nav a {
    font-size: 10px;
    margin-left: 9px;
  }

  .hero {
    flex-direction: column;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 125px 7% 65px;
    gap: 40px;
  }

  .intro {
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .bunny-box {
    flex: auto;
    width: 85%;
    max-width: 320px;
  }

  section:not(.hero) {
    padding: 70px 7%;
  }

  .about-grid,
  .hobby-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .hobbies {
    margin: 0 2%;
  }

  .message {
    padding: 75px 8% !important;
  }
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *, *::before, *::after {
    animation: none !important;
    scroll-behavior: auto !important;
    transition: none !important;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div id="effects"></div>

<nav>
  <div class="logo">♡ USAGI</div>
  <div>
    <a href="#home">TRANG CHỦ</a>
    <a href="#about">GIỚI THIỆU</a>
    <a href="#hobbies">SỞ THÍCH</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- TRANG CHỦ -->
<header class="hero" id="home">

  <div class="hero-text">
    <div class="tag">🐰 WELCOME TO MY LITTLE WORLD</div>

    <h1>Xin chào,<br>tao là<br><span>Lê Minh Nhật!</span></h1>

    <div class="number">✿ HỌC SINH · SỐ 30 ✿</div>

    <p class="intro">
      Chào mừng mày đến với thế giới nhỏ của tao!
